# Third-party notices

This project is MIT-licensed (see LICENSE). Small pieces of the DSH product are
reproduced here because the plugin has to match the host's look and feel:

## Left-sidebar "Plugins" glyph

`lib/src/ui.js` (`LeftSidebarPluginsIcon`) reproduces the pinwheel SVG path data
of the Host's plugin icon so the plugin can shadow that sidebar cell and draw an
update badge. The artwork comes from DeepSeek Harness
(`@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives`, `IconPluginPinwheelOutlineRegular`).

