The full MIT text that applies to that artwork is reproduced in the DSH package
`LICENSE` (same MIT license text as this repository's LICENSE). The plugin does
not copy any other DSH source code; it only calls the Host's public extension
points (slots, the sidebar-right tab registry, and the plugin-manager Remote).

## Toast presentation

The toast position (top center, 40 px from the top), padding, radius and shadow
follow the Host's own toast styling (measured from the built
`@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-frontend` bundle) so the plugin notification matches the
product. No stylesheet or component code from the Host is copied; only the
layout measurements and the `--dsw-*` theme token names are reused, with
token fallbacks so a renamed token degrades appearance rather than rendering.

## Reference plugins

`dsh-better-sidebar`, `dsh-pet`, `dsh-context` and `dsh-whale-widget` were used
as installed integration targets and API references. No code from them is
included in this package.
